---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Lead Ship" description="Learn how Lead Ship's AI-powered marketing operations platform is transforming B2B demand generation.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-950 via-navy-900 to-navy-800 pt-32 pb-16 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-24 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Built by Marketing Operations Professionals</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        More than 25 years of real-world experience managing B2B demand generation, content syndication, and marketing operations — distilled into one AI-powered platform.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Problem -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">The Problem</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 space-y-6">
          <p>
            Today's Marketing Operations teams spend an enormous amount of time managing disconnected systems instead of generating revenue.
          </p>
          <p>
            Campaign quoting, vendor coordination, creative approvals, lead validation, routing, compliance, reporting, analytics, and billing are often spread across multiple software platforms, spreadsheets, emails, and manual processes. The result is wasted time, duplicated effort, slower campaign launches, higher operational costs, and valuable internal resources tied up performing administrative tasks instead of focusing on strategic initiatives.
          </p>
          <p>
            As organizations scale their demand generation programs, these inefficiencies become increasingly expensive — creating unnecessary friction that slows growth and reduces productivity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Solution -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">The Solution</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 space-y-6">
          <p>
            Lead Ship is the industry's first <strong class="text-gray-900">end-to-end AI-powered Marketing Operations platform</strong> built specifically for organizations managing B2B demand generation and content syndication campaigns.
          </p>
          <p>
            Unlike traditional software that addresses only one piece of the process, Lead Ship manages the entire campaign lifecycle — from campaign requests and quote management through lead partner coordination, AI-powered validation, intelligent routing, reporting, analytics, and accounting integration — all within one intuitive platform.
          </p>
          <p>
            Artificial Intelligence isn't simply another feature — it's the intelligence that powers the platform. From campaign setup through reporting and billing, AI continuously works behind the scenes to reduce manual effort, improve accuracy, and accelerate campaign execution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Workflow -->
        <div class="mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-4">The Complete Workflow</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold">
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Request</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Quote</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Partners</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Validate</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Route</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Report</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Bill</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">Every stage connected — complete visibility, automation, and operational control from initial request through invoice generation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TrueModel AI Verification -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div class="fade-up">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent text-sm font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09zM18.259 8.715L18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 002.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 002.455 2.456L21.75 6l-1.036.259a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455 2.456zM16.894 20.567L16.5 21.75l-.394-1.183a2.25 2.25 0 00-1.423-1.423L13.5 18.75l1.183-.394a2.25 2.25 0 001.423-1.423l.394-1.183.394 1.183a2.25 2.25 0 001.423 1.423l1.183.394-1.183.394a2.25 2.25 0 00-1.423 1.423z" />
            </svg>
            TrueModel™ AI Verification
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Not Just Valid Contacts — The Right Contacts</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Most lead validation platforms verify contact information. Lead Ship goes significantly further.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            TrueModel™ Verification evaluates a prospect's actual business model using live operational, regulatory, technographic, and firmographic intelligence — not simply self-reported industry classifications. If a prospect doesn't possess the infrastructure, technologies, licenses, or business characteristics required by your Ideal Customer Profile, the lead is automatically rejected before it ever reaches your CRM.
          </p>
          <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Higher lead quality
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Fewer false positives
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Cleaner CRM data
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Higher sales acceptance rates
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Less wasted SDR time
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Improved marketing ROI
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-up bg-surface rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-12 border border-gray-100 aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center text-gray-400">
            <svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 opacity-50" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-sm">TrueModel™ AI diagram</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Serve -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Who We Serve</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-500">Purpose-built for organizations that rely on sophisticated B2B demand generation programs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto stagger">
        <div class="fade-up bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 7.5h1.5m-1.5 3h1.5m-7.5 3h7.5m-7.5 3h7.5m3-9h3.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25M16.5 7.5V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25M16.5 7.5V4.875c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H4.125C3.504 3.75 3 4.254 3 4.875V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h13.5M6 7.5h3v3H6v-3z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">B2B Publishers</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Manage content syndication campaigns and lead delivery programs at scale.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0l-1 3m8.5-3l1 3m0 0l.5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0l-.5 1.5M9 11.25v1.5M12 9v3.75m3-6v6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Demand Gen Agencies</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Coordinate multi-client campaigns with centralized partner management and reporting.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 004.5 4.5H18a3.75 3.75 0 001.332-7.257 3 3 0 00-3.758-3.848 5.25 5.25 0 00-10.233 2.33A4.502 4.502 0 002.25 15z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">SaaS Companies</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Scale demand generation programs with AI-powered validation and automated delivery.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 6h9.75M10.5 6a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 10-3 0M3.75 6H7.5m3 12h9.75m-9.75 0a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-3.75 0H7.5m9-6h3.75m-3.75 0a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-9.75 0h9.75" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Marketing Ops Teams</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Replace disconnected tools with one unified platform for the entire demand gen workflow.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Revenue Ops Teams</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Full visibility into spend, performance, and ROI across all demand generation programs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 21h19.5m-18-18v18m10.5-18v18m6-13.5V21M6.75 6.75h.75m-.75 3h.75m-.75 3h.75m3-6h.75m-.75 3h.75m-.75 3h.75M6.75 21v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21M3 3h12m-.75 4.5H21m-3.75 3H21m-3.75 3H21" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Enterprise Marketing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Enterprise-grade governance, compliance, and reporting for large-scale lead programs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">What We Believe</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto stagger">
        <div class="fade-up text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-accent/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 01-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 01-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0112 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 01-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 01-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 013 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 011.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 013.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0112 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 013.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 011.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0121 12z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Reliability</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500">Campaigns executed on time, every time. Your buyers and partners should never wonder where things stand.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-accent/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Transparency</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500">Full visibility into every step of your marketing operations workflow. Audit trails, delivery history, and real-time status — nothing hidden.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-up text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-accent/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Simplicity</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500">Powerful enterprise software doesn't have to be complicated. Intuitive from day one — teams are productive quickly with minimal training.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Business Outcomes -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Business Outcomes</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-500">Lead Ship helps organizations achieve measurable results across their demand generation programs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto stagger">
        <div class="fade-up flex items-start gap-3 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Replace multiple marketing operations tools with one unified platform</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-up flex items-start gap-3 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Reduce campaign setup time through AI-powered workflow automation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-up flex items-start gap-3 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Eliminate manual coordination between internal teams and lead partners</span>
        </div>
